{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":19,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. A Psalm by David."},{"n":1,"text":"The heavens declare the glory of God. The expanse shows his handiwork.","tok":[{"t":"The","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" heavens declare "},{"t":"the","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" glory "},{"t":"of","s":["H4210"]},{"t":" God. "},{"t":"The","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" expanse shows "},{"t":"his","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" handiwork."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Day after day they pour out speech, and night after night they display knowledge.","tok":[{"t":"Day after day "},{"t":"they","s":["H3027"]},{"t":" pour "},{"t":"out","s":["H3027"]},{"t":" speech, "},{"t":"and","s":["H8064"]},{"t":" night after night "},{"t":"they","s":["H3027"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"display","s":["H5046"]},{"t":" knowledge."}]},{"n":3,"text":"There is no speech nor language where their voice is not heard.","tok":[{"t":"There","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"is","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" no speech "},{"t":"nor","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" language where "},{"t":"their","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" voice "},{"t":"is","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" not heard."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Their voice has gone out through all the earth, their words to the end of the world. In them he has set a tent for the sun,","tok":[{"t":"Their","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"voice","s":["H6963"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"has","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" gone out "},{"t":"through","s":["H6963"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"all","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" earth, "},{"t":"their","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"to","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" end "},{"t":"of","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" world. "},{"t":"In","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"them","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"he","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"has","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" set "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" tent "},{"t":"for","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" sun,"}]},{"n":5,"text":"which is as a 